    <string name="login_note">Signing in works exactly like iCloud on the web: your password is SRP-encrypted and sent straight to Apple. This app never stores it — only the session token Apple issues afterwards. If two-factor authentication is on, the next step asks for an SMS code, so an iPhone is not required.</string>

